Upaes
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 28 DEAL COLUMN
FAKU 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
FAKU 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
FAKU 5 FACE_LAST
FAKU 3 FACE_LAST

COLUMN 8 FACE_LAST
COLUMN 5 FACE_LAST
COLUMN 8 FACE_LAST

XAGOW 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
XAGOW 8 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
XAGOW 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
XAGOW 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
XAGOW 8 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE COLUMN FAKU
AND
    OR
        DESTSRC Rank add_14
        DEST Size <= 6
    DEST Suit {SPADES, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}
MOVE FAKU XAGOW
SRC Rank K
DRAW
PILE ALL DRAW Empty
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
    PILE ALL XAGOW Empty
